I realized I had seen at least a dozen of these invitations before - from other weddings that we were invited to. I immediately realized that I wanted to do something different. I went onto Etsy to see what the cost of theirs were and how long it would take to get them and the shipping and so on. Then I realized that a lot of the sellers on their sell their digital copies. I choose a design - it was only $20 for the digital copy and you get 4 drafts so you can change what you want it to say 4 times. that also included an event info card and a thank you card to match. There were 6 different cards you could choose from ie save the dates, invitations, thank you cards, info cards, rsvp, bag tags and it was $20 flat for them 3. I just went to get go them ordered at staples on matte paper and the cost to have 80 invitations and 80 event info cards printed out were only $65 dollars. I could not believe it!! I looked on vistra print and I know they were around $1 a print but this was better. Just an fyi for anyone out there looking for something else to do for their invites. you can get them printed anywhere really. This also included envelopes!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869381,"PostDate":1409162420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was trying to decide from vistaprint which wedding invitations that I was going to use when I realized I had seen at least a dozen of these invitations before - from other weddings that we were invited to. I immediately realized that I wanted to do something different. I went onto Etsy to see what the cost of theirs were and how long it would take to get them and the shipping and so on. Then I realized that a lot of the sellers on their sell their digital copies. I choose a design - it was only $20 for the digital copy and you get 4 drafts so you can change what you want it to say 4 times. that also included an event info card and a thank you card to match. There were 6 different cards you could choose from ie save the dates, invitations, thank you cards, info cards, rsvp, bag tags and it was $20 flat for them 3. I just went to get go them ordered at staples on matte paper and the cost to have 80 invitations and 80 event info cards printed out were only $65 dollars. I could not believe it!! I looked on vistra print and I know they were around $1 a print but this was better. Just an fyi for anyone out there looking for something else to do for their invites. you can get them printed anywhere really. This also included envelopes!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kandkjanzen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.141.108.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406139765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Smellsey","Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.161.117","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77894,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd9c7a5411831443d70f032d2ec0f872","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Smellsey\" post=\"1869381\" timestamp=\"1409162420\"]\nI was trying to decide from vistaprint which wedding invitations that I was going to use when I realized I had seen at least a dozen of these invitations before - from other weddings that we were invited to. I immediately realized that I wanted to do something different. I went onto Etsy to see what the cost of theirs were and how long it would take to get them and the shipping and so on. Then I realized that a lot of the sellers on their sell their digital copies. I choose a design - it was only $20 for the digital copy and you get 4 drafts so you can change what you want it to say 4 times. that also included an event info card and a thank you card to match. There were 6 different cards you could choose from ie save the dates, invitations, thank you cards, info cards, rsvp, bag tags and it was $20 flat for them 3. I just went to get go them ordered at staples on matte paper and the cost to have 80 invitations and 80 event info cards printed out were only $65 dollars. I could not believe it!! I looked on vistra print and I know they were around $1 a print but this was better. Just an fyi for anyone out there looking for something else to do for their invites. you can get them printed anywhere really. This also included envelopes![\/quote]Who are you purchasing from? I would like to check it out too!","Attachments":[],"Id":1869383,"PostDate":1409163257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Smellsey, on 27 August 2014 - 10:00 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I was trying to decide from vistaprint which wedding invitations that I was going to use when I realized I had seen at least a dozen of these invitations before - from other weddings that we were invited to. I immediately realized that I wanted to do something different. I went onto Etsy to see what the cost of theirs were and how long it would take to get them and the shipping and so on. Then I realized that a lot of the sellers on their sell their digital copies. I choose a design - it was only $20 for the digital copy and you get 4 drafts so you can change what you want it to say 4 times. that also included an event info card and a thank you card to match. There were 6 different cards you could choose from ie save the dates, invitations, thank you cards, info cards, rsvp, bag tags and it was $20 flat for them 3. I just went to get go them ordered at staples on matte paper and the cost to have 80 invitations and 80 event info cards printed out were only $65 dollars. I could not believe it!! I looked on vistra print and I know they were around $1 a print but this was better. Just an fyi for anyone out there looking for something else to do for their invites. you can get them printed anywhere really. This also included envelopes!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Who are you purchasing from? I would like to check it out too!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394133176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.141.108.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77894,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6bfe7c99dfd560b5e4d4cb05eaf8e44","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/LeeLeeAndTheBee?ref=l2-shop-info-avatar&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/LeeLeeAndTheBee?ref=l2-shop-info-avatar&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is a link to her shop. I believe she has a category that is wedding related. I choose the \"beach surf side\" invitation. She has been awesome to work with and responses with my changes in less than a day.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869385,"PostDate":1409163697,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/LeeLeeAndTheBee?ref=l2-shop-info-avatar' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...hop-info-avatar<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is a link to her shop. I believe she has a category that is wedding related. I choose the \"beach surf side\" invitation. She has been awesome to work with and responses with my changes in less than a day.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kandkjanzen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.141.108.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406139765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Smellsey","Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"27.32.198.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77894,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca32404264dbe64249c196611f44dcba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Smellsey\"] Wow, nice work. That&#039;s a really great choice. I&#039;m an artist my self and I really like her work! Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869446,"PostDate":1409189742,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279143\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279143-smellsey\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Smellsey<\/span><\/a> Wow, nice work. That's a really great choice. I'm an artist my self and I really like her work! Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i651.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu236\/shalsim\/profile\/wedding-caketopper-Belinda-Josh-thumb.png\" alt=\"wedding-caketopper-Belinda-Josh-thumb.pn\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/icingtons.com\/app'>http:\/\/icingtons.com\/app<\/a><\/p>\n<p>BTW I helped create this wedding announcement app. (I did the graphics for them). Now <em>I'm <\/em>the one getting married!","Email":"angearmani@gmail.com","IpAddress":"27.32.198.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408739822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279534.png?_r=1409034001","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Belinosh","Id":279534,"Name":"Belinosh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"125.62.111.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77894,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7751638020c3b7e88b5ed6b829634e54","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow, nice and great work. That&#039;s really awesome post.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911002,"PostDate":1455707977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow, nice and great work. That's really awesome post.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jonesharry@zoho.com","IpAddress":"125.62.124.171","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1448518593,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285438.png?_r=1456302282","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedNa