gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am so thrilled to start this journey! However, I am having a hard time finding the perfect country to host our Indian Destination Wedding! We are looking for a sunny place in Europe to host it, however we are afraid prices will be too high!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know of a good destination location in Europe in which prices are not sky high?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much in advance, and good luck to all other future brides :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911633,"PostDate":1457374489,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Helloooo!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so thrilled to start this journey! However, I am having a hard time finding the perfect country to host our Indian Destination Wedding! We are looking for a sunny place in Europe to host it, however we are afraid prices will be too high!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone know of a good destination location in Europe in which prices are not sky high?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much in advance, and good luck to all other future brides <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1987jpatel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"93.102.240.22","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1457373028,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JPatel1987","Id":286431,"Name":"JPatel1987","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.142.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be492e0aa2017ba5fd6f7138458af196","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming dw, JPatel1987!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll find lots of resources here to help with your planning questions, so well done on getting off to a great start already :) We&#039;re based in Playa del Carmen Mexico, so can tell you that this is an awesome destination for some amazing weddings we&#039;ve captured here.....to show you what we&#039;re talking about, here are some magical wedding moments that matter for inspiration - enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq&#039;&gt;MTM Blog posts&lt;\/a&gt; of a recent &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Barcelo-Maya-Palace-Wedding-Hindu-Iranian\/k7mfu\/56b02c840cf2fb0f6fe8af77&#039;&gt;Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - namaste! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911635,"PostDate":1457379319,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming dw, JPatel1987!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll find lots of resources here to help with your planning questions, so well done on getting off to a great start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We're based in Playa del Carmen Mexico, so can tell you that this is an awesome destination for some amazing weddings we've captured here.....to show you what we're talking about, here are some magical wedding moments that matter for inspiration - enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>Taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>MTM Blog posts<\/a> of a recent <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Barcelo-Maya-Palace-Wedding-Hindu-Iranian\/k7mfu\/56b02c840cf2fb0f6fe8af77' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - namaste! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.51.43.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0539c8fd9c9a1f8bbe8f12153f0908ee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement and on the start of a journey that is sure to be exciting! You have definitely come to the right place :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Europe is such a magical place and I really enjoyed my time traveling there :) While I can&#039;t give you ideas on European locations, I suggest you reach out to one of the forum travel agents who have a lot of expertise and insight when it comes to planning Indian Destination Weddings. They are a great resource and can give you a lot of advice on the best locations throughout the world for Indian Destination Weddings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;If you want to get some ideas of pricing, you might want to try one of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;BDW Travel Agents.&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;  They Specialize in Destination weddings. &amp;nbsp;You can&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;contact them HERE!&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Off the top of my head one country that comes to mind that you may want to consider is Mexico, the Riviera Maya area specifically, which has a group of extremely experienced and talented vendors who specialize in Indian destination weddings. This area is also equipped with wonderful resorts that can accommodate large groups involved in numerous special customs and events like that of Indian Weddings. And there are some great resorts like Moon Palace in Cancun that actually offer delicious Indian cuisine on site -- if that is an important aspect when it comes to planning your wedding (I can attest to this because I enjoyed some of that amazing Indian cuisine just last week!!! ;) )&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As one of the Content Curators on this site, I also want to give you a heads up that we are actually going to be producing a lot of content on this site in the coming weeks geared toward Indian Destination Wedding brides. Here are some blog features we&#039;ve actually posted in reference to Indian destination wedding planning:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-should-you-use-a-travel-agent-when-p-r2311&#039;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Should You Use a Travel Agent When Planning an Indian Destination Wedding?&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-should-i-plan-a-trip-to-my-destinati-r2316&#039;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);\"&gt;Should I plan a trip to my destination wedding location prior to the Big Day? If so, how many visits would you advise?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-what-kind-of-budget-should-i-set-asi-r2307?st=0&#039;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);\"&gt;What Kind of Budget Should I Set Aside When Planning my Indian Destination Wedding?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps a little, and congrats once again! Definitely reach out to one of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;BDW Travel Agents&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;when it comes to location ideas -- I think they are an incredible resource and will be a huge help in finding the perfect location to host the wedding of your dreams!!!!&amp;nbsp; :wub:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911642,"PostDate":1457394685,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your engagement and on the start of a journey that is sure to be exciting! You have definitely come to the right place <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Europe is such a magical place and I really enjoyed my time traveling there <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> While I can't give you ideas on European locations, I suggest you reach out to one of the forum travel agents who have a lot of expertise and insight when it comes to planning Indian Destination Weddings. They are a great resource and can give you a lot of advice on the best locations throughout the world for Indian Destination Weddings.\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">If you want to get some ideas of pricing, you might want to try one of the\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>BDW Travel Agents.<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">\u00a0\u00a0They Specialize in Destination weddings. \u00a0You can\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>contact them HERE!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Off the top of my head one country that comes to mind that you may want to consider is Mexico, the Riviera Maya area specifically, which has a group of extremely experienced and talented vendors who specialize in Indian destination weddings. This area is also equipped with wonderful resorts that can accommodate large groups involved in numerous special customs and events like that of Indian Weddings. And there are some great resorts like Moon Palace in Cancun that actually offer delicious Indian cuisine on site -- if that is an important aspect when it comes to planning your wedding (I can attest to this because I enjoyed some of that amazing Indian cuisine just last week!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> )\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As one of the Content Curators on this site, I also want to give you a heads up that we are actually going to be producing a lot of content on this site in the coming weeks geared toward Indian Destination Wedding brides. Here are some blog features we've actually posted in reference to Indian destination wedding planning:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-should-you-use-a-travel-agent-when-p-r2311' class='bbc_url' title=''><em>Should You Use a Travel Agent When Planning an Indian Destination Wedding?<\/em><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-should-i-plan-a-trip-to-my-destinati-r2316' class='bbc_url' title=''><em><span  style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33)\">Should I plan a trip to my destination wedding location prior to the Big Day? If so, how many visits would you advise?<\/span><\/em><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-what-kind-of-budget-should-i-set-asi-r2307?st=0' class='bbc_url' title=''><em><span  style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33)\">What Kind of Budget Should I Set Aside When Planning my Indian Destination Wedding?<\/span><\/em><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps a little, and congrats once again! Definitely reach out to one of the\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>BDW Travel Agents<\/a>\u00a0when it comes to location ideas -- I think they are an incredible resource and will be a huge help in finding the perfect location to host the wedding of your dreams!!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285957945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.50.165.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b676227a3f9bc3b33b076acef0ed8c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JPatel1987\"] congratulations on your upcoming destination wedding and welcome to BDW! &amp;nbsp;As @[member=\"MarieSamSanchezPhoto\"] mentioned there are a lot of factors that go with picking the right destination for your wedding especially if you are planning to have a religious ceremony and\/or events. &amp;nbsp;I used to live in London so I have travelled all over Europe but I primarily plan weddings in Mexico or the Caribbean especially for my Indian weddings. &amp;nbsp;You can email me at preety@travelbyplatinum with any specific&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;questions or&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;contact us through this form&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;with any questions as I am one of the TA&#039;s for BDW and specialize in Indian Weddings. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911662,"PostDate":1457478851,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286431\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286431-jpatel1987\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JPatel1987<\/span><\/a> congratulations on your upcoming destination wedding and welcome to BDW! \u00a0As @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232833\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232833-mariesamsanchezphoto\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MarieSamSanchezPhoto<\/span><\/a> mentioned there are a lot of factors that go with picking the right destination for your wedding especially if you are planning to have a religious ceremony and\/or events. \u00a0I used to live in London so I have travelled all over Europe but I primarily plan weddings in Mexico or the Caribbean especially for my Indian weddings. \u00a0You can email me at preety@travelbyplatinum with any specific\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">questions or\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">contact us through this form\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">with any questions as I am one of the TA's for BDW and specialize in Indian Weddings. \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><b>Preety Jaswal - Canadian Wedding Specialist<\/b><\/p>\n<div style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG' title=\"External link\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>?<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' title=\"\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/div>\n","Email":"preety@travelbyplatinum.com","IpAddress":"69.50.165.200","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1448921039,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285479.jpg?_r=1450836897","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TAPreety","Id":285479,"Name":"TAPreety","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.248.135.213","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0151750b8c3b911703c600663408c7ab","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Moments That Matter\" post=\"1911635\" timestamp=\"1457375719\"]\nWelcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming dw, JPatel1987!!!\n\nYou&#039;ll find lots of resources here to help with your planning questions, so well done on getting off to a great start already :) We&#039;re based in Playa del Carmen Mexico, so can tell you that this is an awesome destination for some amazing weddings we&#039;ve captured here.....to show you what we&#039;re talking about, here are some magical wedding moments that matter for inspiration - enjoy!!!\nTaken from our [url=\"http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq\"]MTM Blog posts[\/url] of a recent [url=\"http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Barcelo-Maya-Palace-Wedding-Hindu-Iranian\/k7mfu\/56b02c840cf2fb0f6fe8af77\"]Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding Story Album: [\/url]\n[img]https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg[\/img]\n\n[img]https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.jpg[\/img]\n\n[img]https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.jpg[\/img]\n\nWishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - namaste! team MTM :)[\/quote]Very cool!!! very beautiful!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1911759,"PostDate":1457691501,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Moments That Matter, on 07 March 2016 - 07:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming dw, JPatel1987!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll find lots of resources here to help with your planning questions, so well done on getting off to a great start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We're based in Playa del Carmen Mexico, so can tell you that this is an awesome destination for some amazing weddings we've captured here.....to show you what we're talking about, here are some magical wedding moments that matter for inspiration - enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>Taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>MTM Blog posts<\/a> of a recent <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Barcelo-Maya-Palace-Wedding-Hindu-Iranian\/k7mfu\/56b02c840cf2fb0f6fe8af77' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a7a76d150e384ecca88ffe5902c3bda2.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_57d9cac7cec445e4b24d132ba09825ae.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - namaste! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Very cool!!! very beautiful!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/u99bet.info\/keo-nha-cai\/'>ty le ma cao<\/a>","Email":"kelbiiztd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"116.100.184.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442309617,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kelbiiztd","Id":284817,"Name":"kelbiiztd","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79980","Title":"Indian Destination Wedding","LastPostDate":1457691501},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
